  "description": "In the year 220X, humanity encountered a lifeform from another dimension — the Bydo.\n\nSurvival or extinction.\n\nThe R-9 fighter, equipped with the ultimate weapon known as the Force, is deployed.\nThough seemingly defeated after a fierce battle, the Bydo return from beyond the dimensional rift.\nThe war continues from the First Bydo Mission (R-TYPE) to the Second Bydo Mission (R-TYPE II).\n\nR-TYPE DX: Music Encore features the ultimate mode, Ultimate Challenge, allowing players to battle through both titles seamlessly.\nFor the first time, this mode includes a full soundtrack.\nArcade-accurate stage themes have been newly implemented — including dedicated tracks for areas that originally shared music — enabling every stage to be played with the same musical structure as the arcade versions.\nExperience newly reconstructed sound created using authentic handheld hardware audio.\n\nThe original R-TYPE and R-TYPE II are also included.\nIn Classic mode, players can choose between monochrome and color versions, preserving the feel of the original release.\n\nModern support features include:\n• Rewind\n• Quick Save & Load\n• Full Power-Up Start\n• Rapid Fire\n\nIn addition, a rich collection of original packaging and manuals is included.\nRelive the deadly war against the Bydo — now with newly realized sound.",
